{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:1990456 mitochondrion-endoplasmic reticulum membrane tethering\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/31875\n\nConsider moving to MF GO:0140474 mitochondrion-endoplasmic reticulum membrane tether activity.\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1KpW90c-WcEKm6caY3jfalDy57ldkg9IBn-ibOvCnaKw/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \nCACAO\t1\nComplexPortal\t9\n~FlyBase\t1~ DONE\nMGI\t1\n~SGD\t6~ DONE\n~UniProt\t7~ DONE\ndictyBase\t5\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nGO:1990456\tinterpro2go\tInterPro:IPR039275 PDZ domain-containing protein 8 > GO:mitochondrion-endoplasmic reticulum membrane tethering ; GO:1990456\nGO:1990456\thamap2go\tHAMAP:MF_03102 > GO:mitochondrion-endoplasmic reticulum membrane tethering ; GO:1990456\nGO:1990456\tunirule2go\tUniRule:UR000106107 > GO:mitochondrion-endoplasmic reticulum membrane tethering ; GO:1990456\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-04-29T23:49:20Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:1990456 mitochondrion-endoplasmic reticulum membrane tethering", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-05-29T17:17:31Z"}
